  "note": "Player-authored weapons in eight categories. Every value is a simulation parameter, not an imported asset. Energy / ballistic / hybrid families share one editable parameter set so a player can design any combination. All weapons feed the six first-class attributes through MF.weapons.six() and MF.sim.compute().",
